---
title: ProximaDB - Request Processing Sequence (REST & gRPC)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant MUX as TCP Multiplexer<br/>:5678
    participant MW as Middleware Chain<br/>Auth→Tenant→Rate→Metrics
    participant REST as REST Handler<br/>Axum
    participant SS as SharedServices
    participant CAT as Catalog Manager
    participant CS as ComputeScheduler
    participant EXEC as Execution Engine
    participant STORE as Storage Engine
    participant WAL as Write-Ahead Log
    participant OBJ as Object Store

    Note over Client,OBJ: === REST Vector Search Flow ===

    Client->>MUX: POST /v2/collections/{id}/search<br/>{vector, top_k, filters}
    MUX->>MUX: Protocol detect: HTTP/1.1
    MUX->>REST: Forward to Axum on :15678

    REST->>MW: Pass through middleware
    MW->>MW: 1. Validate JWT/API key
    MW->>MW: 2. Extract TenantContext
    MW->>MW: 3. Check rate limits
    MW->>MW: 4. Record request metrics

    REST->>SS: route_search(collection_id, query)
    SS->>CAT: resolve_collection(tenant, collection)
    CAT-->>SS: CollectionMetadata + EngineConfig

    SS->>CS: route_select(plan, freshness)
    CS->>CS: Cost-based engine selection
    CS-->>SS: ComputeBackend::NativeVolcano

    SS->>EXEC: execute(plan, context)
    EXEC->>STORE: search(vectors, filters, top_k)
    STORE->>STORE: HNSW/IVF index scan
    STORE->>STORE: Post-filter metadata
    STORE-->>EXEC: TopK results

    EXEC-->>SS: ExecutionPipelineResult
    SS-->>REST: SearchResponse
    REST-->>Client: JSON response {results, scores, latency}

    Note over Client,OBJ: === gRPC Insert + WAL Flow ===

    Client->>MUX: grpc.InsertVectors(stream)
    MUX->>MUX: Protocol detect: HTTP/2
    MUX->>MW: gRPC interceptor chain
    MW-->>SS: Authenticated request

    SS->>WAL: append(records, tenant_ctx)
    WAL->>WAL: Serialize + checksum
    WAL->>OBJ: write(DrPathBuilder::wal_path)
    OBJ-->>WAL: ACK

    WAL->>STORE: notify_new_delta(delta_lsn)
    SS-->>Client: InsertResponse{count, lsn}

    Note over Client,OBJ: === pgwire SELECT Flow ===

    Client->>MUX: PostgreSQL wire connect :5433
    MUX-->>Client: ReadyForQuery

    Client->>MUX: Query: SELECT * FROM t WHERE x > 10 ORDER BY y LIMIT 5
    MUX->>SS: pgwire protocol handler

    SS->>CS: route_select(sql_plan)
    CS->>CS: Check: parquet-backed table?
    alt Parquet-backed table (OLAP)
        CS->>EXEC: ComputeBackend::DataFusion
        EXEC->>STORE: DataFusion scan with pushdown
    else Vector collection (OLTP)
        CS->>EXEC: ComputeBackend::NativeVolcano
        EXEC->>STORE: Volcano row-wise scan
    end
    STORE-->>EXEC: Arrow RecordBatches
    EXEC-->>SS: ExecutionPipelineResult
    SS-->>Client: DataRow... CommandComplete(5)
